            "type": "TABLE",
            "data": "Database ID\tNRW File identifier\tTitle\tResource Identifier\tNRW Internal Location\tNRW Internal Custodian\tXML Data\tValidation Status\tEdit Status\tDate Last Edited\tLast Editor Name\tGroups Available in (GEMINI / MEDIN)\tRecord in Public view\n19752\td5829acd-4c02-4542-b5ea-6c8951a346f4\t3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\td5829acd-4c02-4542-b5ea-6c8951a346f4\tINTERNAL LOCATION TEST: Archived as Project 360, Media #1590. GIS layer: X:\\Layer_Files\\Biology\\Species\\Example_MEDIN_Compliant_Full_Field.lyr.\tData Custodians SME: John Smith, Otter specialist. Geospatial Custodian: Joe Bloggs, Geospatial Officer.\t\u003cgmd:MD_Metadata xmlns:gmd\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd\" xmlns:gco\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gco\" xmlns:srv\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/srv\" xmlns:gmx\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmx\" xmlns:gts\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gts\" xmlns:gsr\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gsr\" xmlns:gmi\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmi\" xmlns:gss\u003d\"http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gss\" xmlns:nrw\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw\" xmlns:gml\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/gml/3.2\" xmlns:xlink\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" xmlns:xsi\u003d\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance\" xmlns:geonet\u003d\"http://www.fao.org/geonetwork\" xsi:schemaLocation\u003d\"http://naturalresources.wales/nrw http://naturalresources.wales/nrw/nrw1.xsd http://www.isotc211.org/2005/gmd http://schemas.opengis.net/csw/2.0.2/profiles/apiso/1.0.0/apiso.xsd\"\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003ed5829acd-4c02-4542-b5ea-6c8951a346f4\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:fileIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:fileIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:language\u003e     \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\"\u003eEnglish\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e   \u003c/gmd:language\u003e   \u003cgmd:parentIdentifier\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNRW_DS116207\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:parentIdentifier\u003e   \u003cgmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ScopeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_ScopeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"dataset\" /\u003e   \u003c/gmd:hierarchyLevel\u003e   \u003cgmd:contact\u003e     \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e       \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eNatural Resources Wales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e       \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e       \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e           \u003cgmd:address\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e               \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eMaes y Ffynnon\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e               \u003cgmd:city\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eBangor\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:city\u003e               \u003cgmd:postalCode\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eLL57 2DW\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:postalCode\u003e               \u003cgmd:country\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWales\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:country\u003e               \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eopendata@cyfoethnaturiolcymru.gov.uk\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Address\u003e           \u003c/gmd:address\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Contact\u003e       \u003c/gmd:contactInfo\u003e       \u003cgmd:role\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_RoleCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_RoleCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"pointOfContact\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:role\u003e     \u003c/gmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e   \u003c/gmd:contact\u003e   \u003cgmd:dateStamp\u003e     \u003cgco:DateTime\u003e2024-11-04T11:34:04.378Z\u003c/gco:DateTime\u003e   \u003c/gmd:dateStamp\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardName\u003e     \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/M25/current/GEMINI/\"\u003eNRW\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardName\u003e   \u003cgmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e1.0\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e   \u003c/gmd:metadataStandardVersion\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"CY\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"wel\"\u003ewel\u003c/gmd:LanguageCode\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:locale\u003e     \u003cgmd:PT_Locale id\u003d\"EN\"\u003e       \u003cgmd:languageCode\u003e         \u003cgmd:LanguageCode codeList\u003d\"http://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/\" codeListValue\u003d\"eng\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:languageCode\u003e       \u003cgmd:characterEncoding\u003e         \u003cgmd:MD_CharacterSetCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#MD_CharacterSetCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"utf8\" /\u003e       \u003c/gmd:characterEncoding\u003e     \u003c/gmd:PT_Locale\u003e   \u003c/gmd:locale\u003e   \u003cgmd:referenceSystemInfo xmlns:gn\u003d\"http://www.fao.org/geonetwork\"\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e       \u003cgmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e         \u003cgmd:RS_Identifier\u003e           \u003cgmd:code\u003e             \u003cgmx:Anchor xlink:href\u003d\"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/27700\"\u003eBritish National Grid (EPSG:27700)\u003c/gmx:Anchor\u003e           \u003c/gmd:code\u003e         \u003c/gmd:RS_Identifier\u003e       \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemIdentifier\u003e     \u003c/gmd:MD_ReferenceSystem\u003e   \u003c/gmd:referenceSystemInfo\u003e   \u003cgmd:identificationInfo\u003e     \u003cgmd:MD_DataIdentification\u003e       \u003cgmd:citation\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_Citation\u003e           \u003cgmd:title xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003e3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e             \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003e3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e               \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e                 \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#CY\"\u003eTeitl Cymraeg: 3.0 Otter TEST Data Discovery *** This is not a real dataset *** FULL FIELD EXAMPLE\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003c/gmd:title\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eFull Field Test Record\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:alternateTitle\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eExample_MEDIN_Compliant_Full_Field.lyr\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:alternateTitle\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2020-12-16\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"creation\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2023-02-03\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"publication\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:date\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Date\u003e               \u003cgmd:date\u003e                 \u003cgco:Date\u003e2024-06-30\u003c/gco:Date\u003e               \u003c/gmd:date\u003e               \u003cgmd:dateType\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_DateTypeCode codeList\u003d\"http://standards.iso.org/iso/19139/resources/gmxCodelists.xml#CI_DateTypeCode\" codeListValue\u003d\"revision\" /\u003e               \u003c/gmd:dateType\u003e             \u003c/gmd:CI_Date\u003e           \u003c/gmd:date\u003e           \u003cgmd:identifier\u003e             \u003cgmd:MD_Identifier\u003e               \u003cgmd:code\u003e                 \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003ed5829acd-4c02-4542-b5ea-6c8951a346f4\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e               \u003c/gmd:code\u003e             \u003c/gmd:MD_Identifier\u003e           \u003c/gmd:identifier\u003e         \u003c/gmd:CI_Citation\u003e       \u003c/gmd:citation\u003e       \u003cgmd:abstract xsi:type\u003d\"gmd:PT_FreeText_PropertyType\"\u003e         \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eTHIS IS NOT REAL DATA. THE FOLLOWING ELEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN TESTED Vertical Datum - we are waiting on encoding advice from MEDIN THE FOLLOWING ELEMENT IS STORED IN THE METADATA and XML BUT IS NOT VISIBLE iN MAIN VIEW/PDF/PERMALINK. However this will be addressed at a later point with the Datum issue. Vertical CRS type e.g. EPSG 5701 • This is NRW\u0027s test dataset to ensure staff can refer back to a fully valid record to help themselves solve validation errors • It is also to ensure all elements are displaying and exporting to multiple XML schemas. The Metadata is written to be compliant with the NRW, MEDIN and GEMINI Standard. • It may temporarily be in public view when checking view formats for the public but will be removed later.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eTHIS IS NOT REAL DATA. THE FOLLOWING ELEMENTS HAVE NOT BEEN TESTED Vertical Datum - we are waiting on encoding advice from MEDIN THE FOLLOWING ELEMENT IS STORED IN THE METADATA and XML BUT IS NOT VISIBLE iN MAIN VIEW/PDF/PERMALINK. However this will be addressed at a later point with the Datum issue. Vertical CRS type e.g. EPSG 5701 • This is NRW\u0027s test dataset to ensure staff can refer back to a fully valid record to help themselves solve validation errors • It is also to ensure all elements are displaying and exporting to multiple XML schemas. The Metadata is written to be compliant with the NRW, MEDIN and GEMINI Standard. • It may temporarily be in public view when checking view formats for the public but will be removed later.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#CY\"\u003eNID DATA GO IAWN YW HWN. Abstract Cymraeg Datganiad priodoli Yn cynnwys gwybodaeth Cyfoeth Naturiol 