use only.   This dataset includes Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS) Field and Agricultural/Crop Information. The dataset has been supplied by the Welsh Government and contains Whole Farm and Field Boundaries, Customer Details with the appropriate Reference Number (CRN) and Crop Information for each Field Boundaries.\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e         \u003cgmd:PT_FreeText\u003e           \u003cgmd:textGroup\u003e             \u003cgmd:LocalisedCharacterString locale\u003d\"#EN\"\u003eThis is a spatial dataset containing the extent and location of farm boundaries for the Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS). It is an external third party dataset owned by the Welsh Government and licensed to Natural Resources Wales (NRW) for internal use only.   This dataset includes Land Parcel Identification System (LPIS) Field and Agricultural/Crop Information. The dataset has been supplied by the Welsh Government and contains Whole Farm and Field Boundaries, Customer Details with the appropriate Reference Number (CRN) and Crop Information for each Field Boundaries.\u003c/gmd:LocalisedCharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:textGroup\u003e         \u003c/gmd:PT_FreeText\u003e       \u003c/gmd:abstract\u003e       \u003cgmd:pointOfContact\u003e         \u003cgmd:CI_ResponsibleParty\u003e           \u003cgmd:organisationName\u003e             \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eWelsh Government\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e           \u003c/gmd:organisationName\u003e           \u003cgmd:contactInfo\u003e             \u003cgmd:CI_Contact\u003e               \u003cgmd:address\u003e                 \u003cgmd:CI_Address\u003e                   \u003cgmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003eCathays Park, Cardiff, CF10 3NQ\u003c/gco:CharacterString\u003e                   \u003c/gmd:deliveryPoint\u003e                   \u003cgmd:electronicMailAddress\u003e                     \u003cgco:CharacterString\u003ewag-en@mailuk.custhelp.com\u003c/